<http://data.silknow.org/object/8b13e16a-d46a-3274-aa05-bbe6d304450e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fan with black lacquer sticks and guards, the guards painted with a Japanese figure against a tree and with geometric designs and foliage and the sticks with a Japanese figure against foliage; the paper leaf is painted on one side with a bird and flowers on a gold ground and, on reverse, Japanese scenes and figures in landscape and interior, inscribed \"à ma chère petite Elève / Margureite Rolfe.  / Souvenir de / Marie Taglioni / Comtesse Douaière Gilbert de /  Voisins / Londres Juillet 1880\"   Attached on green braid a magenta tassel and a royal blue tassel."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8b13e16a-d46a-3274-aa05-bbe6d304450e> .

